[Sally] Bells Kitchen is known for their delicious boxed lunches. Items such as potato salad, chicken salad, tuna salad, deviled eggs, cheese wafers and an array of cup cakes are made fresh from scratch daily. They sell thousands of sandwiches,[ cup]cakes and hundreds of pounds of salads each year. This establishment is very welcoming, friendly and certainly has[ southern] charm. The staff is just wonderful![]

